        <mxCell id="truth_panel" value="&lt;b&gt;ARCHITECTURE SEMANTICS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• SOE, EAE and HRGE are separate Qwen3-4B + QLoRA neural models.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• KG records are serialized into prompts; there is no graph neural network.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• EVGE, CFE and PGE are deterministic filters/compositions, not trained networks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• The diagram shows logical parallelism; the single-GPU run is sequential." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;fontColor=#17324d;fillColor=#f7fafc;strokeColor=#9fb3c8;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
